e, Nuvolari was leading Brivio by four seconds with a gap of two minutes to Tadini in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Due to difficulties with his fuel supply, Brivio slowed his pace, which allowed Nuvolari to widen the gap between them.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":32,"text":"Farina's small Maserati wins the fight for fourth with Comotti's Alfa Romeo; the rain continues.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":40,"text":"After 40 laps Nuvolari leads Brivio by almost 11 seconds, Tadini 33 seconds back.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Nuvolari wins to ovations from the crowd, ahead of Brivio and Tadini.","q":false,"c":0}]}